<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Biblioteca de Referentes — {{ niche }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --bg: #0a0e18; --bg-soft: #0d1322; --surface: #111a2e; --surface-2: #0e1626;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,.08); --border-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    --text: #e7ecf7; --muted: #8b92a8; --muted-2: #5f6780;
    --accent: #2dd4ee; --accent-soft: rgba(45,212,238,.12);
    --gold: #eaa63e; --gold-soft: rgba(234,166,62,.14);
    --tier-alta: #34d399; --tier-alta-bg: rgba(52,211,153,.12);
    --tier-media: #60a5fa; --tier-media-bg: rgba(96,165,250,.12);
    --tier-emergente: #9aa4bd; --tier-emergente-bg: rgba(154,164,189,.10);
    --good: #34d399; --shopify-bg: rgba(52,211,153,.12); --shopify-text: #34d399;
    --warn: #eaa63e; --warn-bg: rgba(234,166,62,.12);
    --danger: #f27272; --danger-bg: rgba(242,114,114,.14);
    --tag-bg: rgba(255,255,255,.05); --tag-text: #b7bed2;
    --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5;
  }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  code { background: var(--tag-bg); border-radius: 4px; padding: .05rem .35rem; font-size: .85em; }

  /* ---------- top bar ---------- */
  .topbar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; padding: 1rem 1.6rem;
    background: var(--bg-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .logo {
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; flex: none;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--gold), #7a4e12);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.3rem;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08), 0 4px 12px rgba(234,166,62,.25);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .radar-sweep { transform-origin: 20px 20px; animation: radar-spin 3s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes radar-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .brand-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .brand-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; }

  /* ---------- niche nav ---------- */
  .niche-nav {
    display: flex; gap: .3rem; padding: .7rem 1.6rem; overflow-x: auto;
    background: var(--bg-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .niche-tab {
    text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted); padding: .45rem .9rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .niche-tab:hover { color: var(--text); background: var(--tag-bg); }
  .niche-tab.active { color: var(--bg); background: var(--accent); }

  /* ---------- page head ---------- */
  .page-head { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.6rem 0; }
  .breadcrumb { color: var(--muted-2); font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  .page-head h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin: 0 0 .3rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .page-head .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.4rem; font-size: .92rem; }

  /* ---------- stat cards ---------- */
  .stats-grid {
    max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.6rem; display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: .8rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: .9rem 1.05rem;
  }
  .stat-card .n { font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.1; }
  .stat-card .label { font-size: .74rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; margin-top: .2rem; }

  /* ---------- info / criteria / claims cards ---------- */
  .info-card {
    max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto 1rem; padding: .9rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: .87rem; color: var(--muted); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
  }
  .info-card { margin-left: 1.6rem; margin-right: 1.6rem; }
  @media (min-width: 1212px) { .info-card { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1180px; } }
  .info-card b { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .info-card.claims-warning { background: var(--warn-bg); border-color: rgba(234,166,62,.35); color: #f0d6a8; }
  .info-card.claims-warning b { color: var(--warn); }
  .claims-badge {
    background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger); border-radius: 6px; padding: .12rem .5rem;
    font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ref-ad.has-claims-risk { outline: 1px solid var(--danger); }

  /* ---------- patterns ---------- */
  .patterns { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto 1.2rem; padding: 0 1.6rem; }
  .patterns h3 { font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--muted-2); margin: 0 0 .6rem; }
  .pattern-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .pill {
    background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px;
    padding: .32rem .8rem; font-size: .8rem; white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ---------- ranking ---------- */
  main { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.6rem 4rem; }
  .ranking-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .6rem; margin: 1.6rem 0 1rem; }
  .ranking-head h2 { font-size: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
  .ranking-head .n { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }

  .tier-section { margin-bottom: 2.6rem; }
  .tier-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; padding-bottom: .5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; color: var(--text);
  }
  .tier-count {
    font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: .1rem .55rem;
  }
  .subniche-section { margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .subniche-title {
    font-size: .82rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--muted-2);
    margin: 0 0 .7rem; font-weight: 600;
  }

  .rank-card {
    display: flex; gap: 1rem; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; margin-bottom: .8rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .rank-num {
    flex: none; width: 2.1rem; text-align: center; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted-2); font-size: 1.05rem; padding-top: .1rem;
  }
  .rank-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .rank-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
  .rank-head h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .flag { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .tier-pill { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 999px; padding: .16rem .6rem; }
  .tier-pill.tier-alta { background: var(--tier-alta-bg); color: var(--tier-alta); }
  .tier-pill.tier-media { background: var(--tier-media-bg); color: var(--tier-media); }
  .tier-pill.tier-emergente { background: var(--tier-emergente-bg); color: var(--tier-emergente); }

  .badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .badge { font-size: .74rem; padding: .18rem .55rem; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .badge-age { background: transparent; color: var(--muted); }
  .badge-shopify { background: var(--shopify-bg); color: var(--shopify-text); border-color: transparent; }
  .badge-score { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); }

  .ref-ad { background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: .7rem .9rem; font-size: .85rem; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
  .ref-ad .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .35rem; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
  .ref-ad .tag { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); border-radius: 6px; padding: .12rem .5rem; font-size: .72rem; }
  .ref-ad .quote { color: var(--text); font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 .4rem; }
  .ref-ad .structure-note {
    background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: 8px; padding: .5rem .7rem;
    margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-style: normal; color: var(--text); font-size: .84rem;
  }
  .ref-ad .structure-note b { color: var(--accent); }
  .ref-ad .meta-credit { display: block; font-size: .74rem; color: var(--muted-2); margin-top: .3rem; }
  .ref-ad a { font-size: .78rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .ref-ad a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .detail-panel {
    background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
    padding: .15rem .9rem .8rem; margin-bottom: .7rem;
  }
  .detail-panel summary {
    cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: .6rem 0; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; user-select: none;
  }
  .detail-panel summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .detail-panel summary::before { content: "▸"; transition: transform .15s; }
  .detail-panel[open] summary::before { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .detail-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(110px, 1fr)); gap: .6rem; margin-bottom: .8rem;
  }
  .detail-stat {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: .55rem .7rem;
  }
  .detail-stat .n { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
  .detail-stat .label { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--muted-2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; margin-top: .1rem; }
  .detail-section { margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .detail-section h4 {
    font-size: .7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--muted-2);
    margin: 0 0 .3rem; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .detail-section p { margin: 0; font-size: .84rem; color: var(--tag-text); }
  .detail-section p b { color: var(--text); }

  .all-ads-panel {
    background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
    padding: .15rem .9rem .5rem; margin-bottom: .7rem;
  }
  .all-ads-panel summary {
    cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: .6rem 0; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--tag-text); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; user-select: none;
  }
  .all-ads-panel summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .all-ads-panel summary::before { content: "▸"; transition: transform .15s; color: var(--accent); }
  .all-ads-panel[open] summary::before { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .all-ads-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: .5rem; max-height: 420px; overflow-y: auto; }
  .all-ads-row {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; padding: .35rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: .78rem;
  }
  .all-ads-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .all-ads-row .tag { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); border-radius: 6px; padding: .1rem .45rem; font-size: .72rem; }
  .all-ads-row a { margin-left: auto; font-size: .76rem; white-space: nowrap; }

  .rank-actions { display: flex; gap: .55rem; margin-top: .4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn {
    text-align: center; text-decoration: none; padding: .48rem .85rem; border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; background: var(--accent); color: #06222b;
  }
  .btn.secondary { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .btn.disabled { background: transparent; color: var(--muted-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); pointer-events: none; }

  footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: var(--muted-2); font-size: .8rem; }
  footer .meta-credit-line { color: var(--muted); margin-top: .3rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="22" height="22"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="17" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".3" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="11" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".45" fill="none"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".6" fill="none"/><g class="radar-sweep"><path d="M20 20 L20 3 A17 17 0 0 1 34.7 11.5 Z" fill="url(#rs)"/></g><circle cx="27" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="#2dd4ee"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.4" fill="#201400"/><defs><linearGradient id="rs" x1="20" y1="20" x2="34.7" y2="11.5" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity=".9"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs></svg></div>
  <div>
    <div class="brand-name">Radar de Ecommerce</div>
    <div class="brand-sub">Ecommerce Creative Intelligence · Biblioteca de Referentes</div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="niche-nav">
  {% for n in all_niches %}
  <a class="niche-tab{{ ' active' if n.active else '' }}" href="{{ n.href }}">{{ n.label }}</a>
  {% endfor %}
</nav>

<div class="page-head">
  <p class="breadcrumb">Radar de Ecommerce / {{ niche | title }}</p>
  <h1>Biblioteca de Referentes — {{ niche | title }}</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">{{ market_flags }} {{ markets | join(' · ') }} · generado {{ generated_at[:10] }}</p>
</div>

<div class="stats-grid">
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{ total }}</div><div class="label">Marcas referentes</div></div>
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{ tier_counts.alta }}</div><div class="label">Escala alta (50+)</div></div>
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{ by_subniche | length }}</div><div class="label">Subnichos</div></div>
  <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">{{ markets | length }}</div><div class="label">Mercados</div></div>
</div>

<div class="info-card">
  Solo entran marcas <b>independientes</b> (nunca SHEIN, Temu, Mercado Libre ni similares
  — ver <code>config/excluded_brands.yaml</code>) con tienda ecommerce real verificada y
  al menos <b>un anuncio activo con {{ min_ad_age_days }}+ días corriendo</b> — la señal de
  que ya encontraron una estrategia que les funciona, no solo un test. Se agrupan por
  <b>nivel de escala</b>: 50+ anuncios activos = escala alta (suelen tener un patrón
  creativo repetido y consistente); menos que eso, referencias más pequeñas pero
  igualmente reales y verificadas.
</div>
{% if is_claims_sensitive_niche %}
<div class="info-card claims-warning">
  ⚠️ Nicho sensible a <b>claims de salud</b>: los anuncios marcados con 🚩 usan lenguaje de
  riesgo (cura/trata/elimina/resultados garantizados). Se muestran como referencia de qué
  hace la competencia, <b>no como copy recomendado para copiar</b> — ese lenguaje puede
  incumplir las políticas de Meta y generar rechazos o bloqueos de cuenta.
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="patterns">
  <h3>¿Qué formato usan más las {{ total }} marcas referentes? (todos sus anuncios activos)</h3>
  <div class="pattern-row">
    <span class="pill">🎬 Video · {{ format_percentages.video }}%</span>
    <span class="pill">🖼️ Imagen · {{ format_percentages.image }}%</span>
    <span class="pill">🎠 Carrusel · {{ format_percentages.carousel }}%</span>
    {% if format_percentages.unknown %}<span class="pill">❔ Sin determinar · {{ format_percentages.unknown }}%</span>{% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="pattern-row">
    <span class="pill">📌 {{ single_format_brands }} de {{ total }} marcas se enfocan en un solo formato</span>
    <span class="pill">🔀 {{ mixed_format_brands }} de {{ total }} combinan varios formatos</span>
  </div>
</div>

{% if top_hooks or top_angles or top_offers %}
<div class="patterns">
  <h3>Patrones comunes entre las {{ total }} marcas referentes (anuncios 30+ días)</h3>
  {% if top_hooks %}
  <div class="pattern-row">
    {% for label, count in top_hooks %}<span class="pill">🪝 {{ label }} · {{ count }}</span>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if top_angles %}
  <div class="pattern-row">
    {% for label, count in top_angles %}<span class="pill">🎯 {{ label }} · {{ count }}</span>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if top_offers %}
  <div class="pattern-row">
    {% for label, count in top_offers %}<span class="pill">🏷️ {{ label }} · {{ count }}</span>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}

<main>
<div class="ranking-head"><h2>Ranking del nicho — <span class="n">{{ total }} marcas</span></h2></div>
{% for tier in tier_order %}
  {% set subniche_groups = by_tier_and_subniche[tier] %}
  {% if subniche_groups %}
  <section class="tier-section tier-{{ tier }}">
    <h2 class="tier-title">{{ tier_labels[tier] }} <span class="tier-count">{{ tier_counts[tier] }}</span></h2>
    {% for subniche, group in subniche_groups.items() %}
    <div class="subniche-section">
      <h3 class="subniche-title">{{ subniche }} ({{ group | length }})</h3>
      {% for b in group %}
        <article class="rank-card">
          <div class="rank-num">#{{ b.rank }}</div>
          <div class="rank-body">
            <div class="rank-head">
              <h3>{{ b.page_name }}</h3>
              <span class="flag">{{ b.market_flag }}</span>
              <span class="tier-pill tier-{{ b.scale_tier }}">{{ tier_labels[b.scale_tier].split(' (')[0] }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="badges">
              <span class="badge badge-age">🕐 {{ b.oldest_active_ad_age_days }} días activo</span>
              {% if b.shopify_detected %}<span class="badge badge-shopify">🛍️ Shopify</span>{% endif %}
              <span class="badge badge-score">Scale {{ b.scale_signal_score }}/100</span>
              <span class="badge badge-score">{{ b.active_ad_count }} anuncios activos</span>
            </div>

            {% for ad in b.long_running_ads[:2] %}
            <div class="ref-ad{{ ' has-claims-risk' if ad.claims_flags else '' }}">
              <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">⏱ {{ ad.age_days }}d</span>
                {% if ad.format %}<span class="tag">{{ "🎬" if ad.format == "video" else "🖼️" }} {{ ad.format }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if ad.hook_type %}<span class="tag">🪝 {{ ad.hook_type }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if ad.creative_angle %}<span class="tag">🎯 {{ ad.creative_angle }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if ad.offer_type and ad.offer_type != 'no_offer' %}<span class="tag">🏷️ {{ ad.offer_type }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if ad.claims_flags %}<span class="claims-badge">🚩 claim de riesgo</span>{% endif %}
              </div>
              {% if ad.primary_text %}<p class="quote">"{{ ad.primary_text }}{{ '…' if ad.primary_text|length >= 220 else '' }}"</p>{% endif %}
              {% if ad.claims_flags %}<p class="claims-badge" style="display:block; margin-bottom:.5rem;">🚩 {{ ad.claims_flags | join(', ') }} — no recomendado copiar tal cual</p>{% endif %}
              {% if ad.format and b.creative_notes.get(ad.format) %}
              <p class="structure-note">🎨 <b>Estructura:</b> {{ b.creative_notes[ad.format] }}</p>
              {% endif %}
              <a href="{{ ad.ad_library_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">▶ Ver este anuncio ↗</a>
              <span class="meta-credit">Anuncio cortesía de Meta Ad Library — se abre en una pestaña nueva de facebook.com, no se aloja aquí.</span>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}

            <details class="all-ads-panel">
              <summary>📋 Todos los anuncios activos ({{ b.all_active_ads_count }})</summary>
              <div class="all-ads-list">
                {% for ad in b.all_active_ads %}
                <div class="all-ads-row">
                  <span class="tag">⏱ {{ ad.age_days }}d</span>
                  {% if ad.format %}<span class="tag">{{ "🎬" if ad.format == "video" else ("🖼️" if ad.format == "image" else ("🎠" if ad.format == "carousel" else "❔")) }} {{ ad.format }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {% if ad.hook_type %}<span class="tag">🪝 {{ ad.hook_type }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {% if ad.creative_angle %}<span class="tag">🎯 {{ ad.creative_angle }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {% if ad.offer_type and ad.offer_type != 'no_offer' %}<span class="tag">🏷️ {{ ad.offer_type }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {% if ad.claims_flags %}<span class="claims-badge">🚩</span>{% endif %}
                  <a href="{{ ad.ad_library_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver ↗</a>
                </div>
                {% else %}
                <p style="color:var(--muted-2); font-size:.8rem; margin:.4rem 0;">Sin anuncios activos registrados.</p>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="detail-panel">
              <summary>Más detalle</summary>
              <div class="detail-grid">
                <div class="detail-stat"><div class="n">{{ b.active_ad_count }}</div><div class="label">Anuncios activos</div></div>
                <div class="detail-stat"><div class="n">{{ b.oldest_active_ad_age_days }}d</div><div class="label">Más antiguo</div></div>
                <div class="detail-stat"><div class="n">{{ b.scale_signal_score }}</div><div class="label">Score LVL ECI</div></div>
                <div class="detail-stat"><div class="n">{{ b.confidence_score }}</div><div class="label">Confianza</div></div>
              </div>
              {% if b.dominant_hook or b.dominant_angle or (b.dominant_offer and b.dominant_offer != 'no_offer') %}
              <div class="detail-section">
                <h4>Oferta y ángulo dominante</h4>
                <p>
                  {% if b.dominant_hook %}Hook: <b>{{ b.dominant_hook }}</b>{% endif %}
                  {% if b.dominant_angle %} · Ángulo: <b>{{ b.dominant_angle }}</b>{% endif %}
                  {% if b.dominant_offer and b.dominant_offer != 'no_offer' %} · Oferta: <b>{{ b.dominant_offer }}</b>{% endif %}
                </p>
              </div>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="detail-section">
                <h4>Variedad creativa (todos sus anuncios activos)</h4>
                <p>
                  🎬 {{ b.video_count }} video · 🖼️ {{ b.image_count }} imagen · 🎠 {{ b.carousel_count }} carrusel
                  {%- if b.unknown_format_count %} · ❔ {{ b.unknown_format_count }} sin determinar{% endif %}
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-section">
                <h4>Confianza y límites</h4>
                <p>
                  Score de confianza {{ b.confidence_score }}/100 — basado en el texto e imágenes visibles
                  en Meta Ad Library (scraping), sin acceso a ventas, gasto real ni métricas internas del
                  anunciante.
                  {% if b.long_running_ads | selectattr('claims_flags') | list %}
                  Al menos uno de sus anuncios de referencia usa lenguaje de riesgo (🚩 arriba) — no se
                  recomienda copiar ese lenguaje tal cual.
                  {% endif %}
                </p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <div class="rank-actions">
              {% if b.ads_library_page_url %}
              <a class="btn" href="{{ b.ads_library_page_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">📣 {{ "Ver anuncios en vivo (Meta) ↗" if b.ads_library_is_page_level else "Ver anuncios de la marca (Meta) ↗" }}</a>
              {% endif %}
              {% if b.store_url %}<a class="btn secondary" href="{{ b.store_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">🛍 Ver tienda ↗</a>{% else %}<span class="btn disabled">Tienda no disponible</span>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not by_subniche %}
  <p style="text-align:center; color:var(--muted); padding: 3rem 0;">
    Sin marcas que cumplan el criterio todavía en este nicho/mercado — corré <code>eci research</code> primero.
  </p>
{% endif %}
</main>

<footer>
  Biblioteca generada automáticamente desde Meta Ad Library en vivo · Ecommerce Creative Intelligence ·
  Señales de presencia publicitaria observable, no de ventas ni rentabilidad.
  <div class="meta-credit-line">Todos los anuncios enlazados son propiedad de sus respectivos anunciantes y se muestran a través de la Biblioteca de Anuncios de Meta (facebook.com/ads/library) — este sitio no aloja ni redistribuye ese contenido, solo enlaza a la fuente oficial.</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
